OL,3,GNEWSAHospital unveils refurbished renal
OL,4,Adialysis unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new-look renal dialysis unit has
OL,7,Fopened at a West Yorkshire hospital
OL,8,Ffollowing months of refurbishment.
OL,10,FNew facilities have been installed at
OL,11,Fthe unit at Bradford Royal Infirmary,
OL,12,Fwith "essential infrastructure
OL,13,Fupgrades" also carried out.
OL,15,FIt offers treatment for severe kidney
OL,16,Finjuries, sudden kidney failure and
OL,17,Fcares for people with chronic or acute
OL,18,Fillnesses.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
