OL,3,GNEWSAHospital unveils refurbished renal
OL,4,Adialysis unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Teaching Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust, which oversees the
OL,8,Fhospital, said the refurbishment marks
OL,9,Fa "significant milestone in the kidney
OL,10,Fcare service".
